Package: cpgdirectionData
Type: Package
Title: Data Layers for the cpgdirection Package (ExperimentHub)
Version: 0.99.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tsachi", "Ein-Dor", email = "teindor@runi.ac.il",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "fnd"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3078-7591")))
Description: ExperimentHub companion to the cpgdirection package. Serves the
    ten data layers too large to ship inside a Bioconductor software
    package: the three tissue catalogue lookup tables (blood, nasal
    epithelium, solid tissue; hg19), the SMR causal-direction table, the
    EPIC v2 hg19 probe positions, the brain SMR directions, the genome-wide
    saliva bridge scores, the multi-source EPIC v2 probe-to-gene
    annotation (five cross-validated annotation tracks with per-track
    support flags), the distal CpG-to-gene links from ENCODE-rE2G
    enhancer-gene predictions (hg38), and the Onco-eQTM cross-tumour
    cis-eQTM consensus (27 TCGA cancer types). Each resource is a
    serialized data.frame retrieved from ExperimentHub on first use and
    cached locally thereafter. The cpgdirection package consumes these
    resources transparently; direct use is possible through the accessors
    documented here.
